{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"for f in Docs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md Docs/AI-Pipeline/00_MASTER_CONTEXT.md Docs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md Docs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md Docs/AI-Pipeline/03_SUPERVISOR_GIT_GITHUB_CONTEXT.md Docs/AI-Pipeline/04_EXECUTION_GER_VALIDATION_CONTEXT.md Docs/AI-Pipeline/05_CONTINUOUS_AUTONOMY_CONTEXT.md Docs/AI-Pipeline/DECISIONS.md; do rg -n '\"'^#{1,4} '\"' \\\"\"'$f\"; done'","aggregated_output":"1:# CURRENT STATE — No Safe Circle AI Pipeline\n7:## Current Phase\n79:## Architecture Review Result\n107:## Architecture Correction Phase 1 — COMPLETE\n123:## Architecture Correction Phase 2 — COMPLETE\n183:## Milestone 1 Bootstrap State Retained\n213:## Production GDD RAG — CURRENT AND VALIDATED\n237:### RAG authority boundary\n251:## Architecture Correction Phase 3A — IMPLEMENTED AND TESTED\n253:### Purpose\n265:### New Phase 3A files\n281:### Evidence record model\n319:### Repository authority boundary\n327:### Deterministic current-state checks\n342:### Derived states\n359:### First real production conformance proof\n401:### Phase 3A regression status\n422:## Provider-Neutral Execution Crew Preparatory Stage 1 — COMPLETE\n460:## Provider-Neutral Execution Crew Stage 3 — COMPLETE\n484:### Stage 3 contract boundary\n497:### Stage 3 runtime safety\n517:### Stage 3 regression status\n534:## Current Dispatch Policy\n575:## Source-of-Truth Boundaries\n577:### Game-design canon\n581:### Production GDD retrieval\n585:### Task contracts\n591:### Integrated implementation\n597:### Delivery/revalidation records\n603:### Current conformance\n611:### AgentRuntime requests/results\n619:### Reconciliation\n625:### Architecture review evidence\n629:## Immediate Next Goal\n631:### Migrate ArchitectureReview through generic AgentRuntime using Claude\n665:## Real Gameplay Task Selection After the Evidence Proof\n688:## Deferred Until Evidence Justifies It\n708:## Obsolete Branch/Plan Warning\n716:## Next Window Instructions\n1:# No Safe Circle — Autonomous AI Development Pipeline\r\n3:## Master Context / Architecture Handoff\r\n11:## Current Architecture Status\r\n33:## Project\r\n47:## Core Architectural Decision\r\n61:## Desired End-to-End Loop\r\n142:## Guiding Principle\r\n173:## Sources of Truth\r\n175:### Root Canon\r\n183:### Approved Design Extensions\r\n207:### Codebase Truth\r\n213:### Durable Work Definition\r\n240:### Operational Status\r\n256:## Milestone 1 Persistent Work Graph\r\n294:### Current Task-Control Interface\r\n308:## Reconciliation Boundary\r\n322:## Progressive Task Decomposition\r\n339:## Artifact Authority\r\n360:## Assignment 3 Integration\r\n378:## Assignment 4 Integration\r\n390:## Assignment 5 Integration\r\n409:## Assignment 6 / GER Integration\r\n441:## Validation Evidence Model\r\n468:## Assignment 7 / Style Evaluator Integration\r\n492:## Git Model\r\n513:## Autonomous Supervisor\r\n553:## Safety / Cost Controls\r\n576:## Parallelism\r\n584:## Near-Term Build Strategy\r\n607:## High-Level Build Milestones\r\n617:## Working Rule\r\n1:# Context 1 — Persistent Work Artifacts + Dependency Graph\r\n3:## Status\r\n19:## Goal That Was Achieved\r\n37:## Bootstrap Provenance\r\n79:## Persistent Graph Produced\r\n118:## Stable IDs and Traceability\r\n130:## Work Kinds\r\n140:### `feature`\r\n146:### `artifact`\r\n152:### `implementation`\r\n156:## Execution Scope Semantics\r\n181:## Status Semantics\r\n196:## Reconciliation Boundary\r\n211:## Core Implementation\r\n230:## `taskcontrol`\r\n242:### `validate`\r\n264:### `ready`\r\n289:### `list`, `show`, and `graph`\r\n297:## Real First-Task Example\r\n312:## Resource-Conflict Semantics\r\n325:## Lessons Preserved from Milestone 1\r\n338:## Completion Criteria — Satisfied\r\n357:## Next\r\n1:# Context 2 — RAG + Project Scanner + Progressive Decomposer\n3:## Goal\n11:## Architecture\n49:## Assignment 4 RAG Role\n66:## Requirement Records\n84:## Approved Artifact Retrieval\n94:## Local Unity/Code Scanner\n115:## Important State Distinction\n128:## Project State Cache\n138:## Context Builder\n160:## Progressive Decomposer\n177:### Decomposer Output\n218:## Artifact Authority Gate\n243:## Artifact Generation\n259:## Artifact GER\n274:### Canon / Design Evaluator\n283:### Completeness Evaluator\n291:### Style Evaluator — Assignment 7\n319:## Artifact Promotion\n348:## Re-Decomposition\n360:## Token-Saving Goal\n372:## Completion Criteria\n385:## Next\n391:## Reconciliation Boundary\n1:# Context 3 — Supervisor + Git Branches/Worktrees + GitHub Tickets/PRs\n3:## Goal\n9:## Critical Design Decision\n15:## Git Strategy\n30:## GitHub Mapping\n46:## Source-of-Truth Split\n54:## Draft PR Early\n65:## Commit Strategy\n79:## Supervisor First Version\n95:## Claims / Leases\n106:## Failure Behavior\n115:## Completion Criteria\n123:## Next\n1:# Context 4 — Agent Crew + GER + Validation / Repair Loop\n3:## Goal\n9:## Assignment 3 Crew Placement\n27:## Planner\n35:## Implementer\n39:## Deterministic Validation First\n53:## Unity Validation\n59:## Fresh AI Diff Review\n71:## Repair Loop\n79:## Assignment 6 — GER\n127:## Cost / Circuit Breakers\n131:## Completion Definition\n139:## Completion Criteria\n143:## Next\n1:# Context 5 — Continuous Autonomous Development\n3:## Goal\n7:## Main Loop\n33:## Principle\n37:## Newly Discovered Blockers\n50:## Planning / Backlog Replenishment\n68:## GDD Change Detection\n72:## GitHub Dashboard\n76:## Merge Safety\n80:## Parallelism\n84:## Observability\n96:## Budget Governance\n100:## Human Intervention Queue\n104:## Long-Term Desired Experience\n112:## Definition of Success\n1:# Architecture Decisions — No Safe Circle AI Pipeline\r\n7:## ADR-001 — Repository state beats conversation memory\r\n15:## ADR-002 — Local supervisor owns autonomy\r\n23:## ADR-003 — Claude receives one bounded ticket\r\n31:## ADR-004 — Task dependency graph is persistent and local\r\n39:## ADR-005 — GitHub is the dashboard, not the project brain\r\n47:## ADR-006 — `main` is protected from autonomous direct development\r\n55:## ADR-007 — Done means merged\r\n63:## ADR-008 — RAG is the canon retrieval layer\r\n71:## ADR-009 — Assignment 3 crew executes tickets\r\n79:## ADR-010 — GER is the bounded self-correction loop for project work\r\n89:## ADR-011 — Cheap deterministic validation should run before expensive semantic review when practical\r\n99:## ADR-012 — Newly discovered substantial work becomes a task\r\n107:## ADR-013 — Start with one worker\r\n115:## ADR-014 — Every autonomous loop has budgets/circuit breakers\r\n123:## ADR-015 — Runtime evidence is first-class validation input\r\n131:## ADR-016 — A no-op refinement is failed progress\r\n139:## ADR-017 — Validation should produce an evidence/feedback bundle\r\n147:## ADR-018 — Old goal-selection artifacts are not current codebase truth\r\n155:## ADR-019 — The pipeline must advance the game while it is being built\r\n163:## ADR-020 — Style evaluation is an evaluator specialization, not a separate architecture\r\n173:## ADR-021 — Task decomposition is progressive and just-in-time\r\n181:## ADR-022 — Missing design creates an artifact proposal, not silent invention\r\n189:## ADR-023 — Generated design requires authority before generation\r\n197:## ADR-024 — Approved artifacts may become subordinate project design state\r\n207:## ADR-025 — Reconciliation results are immutable point-in-time snapshots\r\n217:## ADR-026 — Reconciliation proposes graph deltas but never directly mutates the persistent graph\r\n229:## ADR-027 — Reconciliation bootstrap requires independent multi-model verification\r\n242:## ADR-029 — Design decomposition and execution scope are separate axes\r\n250:## ADR-030 — Current output view is mutable; run history stays nested and immutable\r\n260:## ADR-035 — Provider-adapter enforcement\r\n274:## ADR-036 — Own the narrow Claude Code and OpenAI/Codex transport adapters\n288:## ADR-039 — Separate generic invocation from NSC task execution\n298:## ADR-040 — OpenAI/Codex AgentRuntime and ArchitectureReview migration\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
