ts/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Editor/NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.Editor.asmdef.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.asmdef\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.asmdef.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/DebugDamageControl.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/DebugDamageControl.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/DebugManaSpendControl.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/DebugManaSpendControl.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/DoorInteractable.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/DoorInteractable.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/DoorInteractionUI.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/DoorInteractionUI.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/IsometricCameraFollow.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/IsometricCameraFollow.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerHealth.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerHealth.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerInteractionController.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerInteractionController.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerMana.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerMana.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerManaUI.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerManaUI.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerMovement.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerMovement.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/DoorInteractionPlayModeTests.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/DoorInteractionPlayModeTests.cs.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/Editor.meta\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/Editor/CommittedSceneCameraConformanceTests.cs\nAssets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/Editor/CommittedScene