n_agent.py:331:            \"Floor Run/Restart feature and orchestrator, current-owner restart bootstrap, \"\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:338:            \"Inspect current reset/death/victory/player-position/door state evidence only \"\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:339:            \"as needed to determine which current owners exist. Rely on GDD ownership for \"\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:364:            \"Inspect ProjectSettings/EditorBuildSettings.asset and package/current-project \"\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:365:            \"evidence only when needed for delivery/build or process/current-state claims. \"\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:631:- keep the stable key when the same responsibility is still required/current;\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:632:- omit it if current GDD/repository truth no longer supports it, and explain why\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:634:- add new same-domain work when the current GDD requires something the previous\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:645:- it does not prove the routed responsibility is still required/current;\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:646:- current GDD + current repository remain authoritative.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:664:- If current truth establishes a cross-domain prerequisite that genuinely has no\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:667:- If current truth no longer supports a listed responsibility, do not preserve it\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:672:1. Read the ENTIRE current GDD before deciding what belongs to this domain.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:682:4. You MAY reference a concrete cross-domain prerequisite when the GDD/cu